.SH DESCRIPTION
This is a macro defined in a public libssh2 header file that is using the
underlying function \fI\fIlibssh2_sftp_symlink_ex(3)\fP\fP.

On an OpenSSH server, \fIorig\fP is the destination stored in the symbolic
